          "body_excerpt": "The line-boundary arg-tag rule (#102303) required the tag at line\nstart, so a cut call with no <tool_call> opener but the tool name on\nthe same line (process_manage<arg_key>action</arg_key>...) leaked raw\nmarkup. Allow an identifier-only prefix before the tag; the prefix has\nno spaces, so prose like 'The <arg_key> holds...' still survives."
